  local-inference-lab/b12x (https://github.com/local-inference-lab/b12x, commit d44247b6: b12x/norm/mhc,
  b12x/sequence/kda_prefill with b12x/sequence/_shared/delta_prefill, b12x/attention/sparse_mla), Copyright 2026
  Luke Alonso and the b12x contributors, Apache License 2.0 (text: vendor/TensorFold/LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt; b12x
  ships no NOTICE file). The Triton kernels in patches/0240-glm-b12x-prefill.patch (glm5_next/cuda/b12x_kda.py,
  b12x_mhc.py, b12x_attn.py) re-implement algorithms and kernel structures of those b12x ops (the 16-token KDA tile
  with its Neumann-product inverse and on-chip fp32 state; the fused hyper-connection post + mixing dots over column
  blocks of all four streams; the one-pass-per-row sparse MLA softmax) on this project's arithmetic; no b12x code is
